#: src/allow-duplicate-variables.md:1
msgid "Allow Duplicate Variables"
msgstr ""

#: src/allow-duplicate-variables.md:3
msgid ""
"If `allow-duplicate-variables` is set to `true`, defining multiple variables "
"with the same name is not an error and the last definition is used. Defaults "
"to `false`."
msgstr ""

#: src/allow-duplicate-variables.md:7
msgid ""
"```just\n"
"set allow-duplicate-variables\n"
"\n"
"a := \"foo\"\n"
"a := \"bar\"\n"
"\n"
"@foo:\n"
"  echo {{a}}\n"
"```"
msgstr ""
